# Neutral Portfolio Demo Environment Template
# For local evaluation, the application provides an automated Zero-Cloud Demo Mock Mode.
# To connect to your own Supabase instance, supply the following values:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-anon-key
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
